{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-15T01:06:06.994Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8883d09363214115c628d33e","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/12","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-15T01:06:06.994Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"DELIVERY CANDIDATE VERIFIED: isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check both PASSED on the frozen source, each 654/654 tests with zero failed/skipped/canceled/TODO, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 13 authored modules, zero production vulnerabilities, and all build/type/docstring/lint/duplication/privacy/pack/changelog/attestation checks green. Bounded worker concurrency preserved every test and deadline; the watchdog passed in both full runs. Focused acceptance is 64/64, linked pm tests 1/1 commands, native Bun 2/2, and both refreshed guard-removal proofs failed before restoration and passed 2/2 after restoration. Optional workflow remains pm-github-0x3y; deterministic watchdog startup remains pm-github-sah1. The reusable sync workflow, inputs, SDK pins and thresholds are unchanged. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification without closing this feature."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-15T01:06:06.994Z"}],"before_hash":"4b4e4977351d56336599eea4872edaa0340de379636cabd6c1fc302eb6c59cfd","after_hash":"c498ed67811abaa61d1a2e43175f28e852747182eb7f746b8ac479434cc90ae5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version